# Contently engineering

Frontend-only Next.js app. Backend is a separate API. Full detail: `docs/engineering.md`.

## Hard rules

- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when required.
- Data via Axios + TanStack Query + Orval-generated clients/types.
- Auth token from cookie → `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
- TanStack Query = server state; Zustand = global UI state; nuqs = URL/filters.
- Forms: React Hook Form + Zod.
- Quality: ESLint + TypeScript + Prettier. Production-grade, clean, optimized.
- Env: Zod-validated module + `.env.example`.
- Use `next/font`, `next/image`, etc. Dynamic-import heavy UI (editor/AI).
- TipTap: deferred until editor work starts.

## Do not

- Put business/persistence logic in this repo.
- Duplicate API data in Zustand.
- Hand-roll API DTO types when Orval already generates them.
